# Core worker (`workers/core`)

- Public HTTP API only. Route map starts in `src/index.ts`; handlers under `src/routes/`.
- Identity: `email` query/body (MVP). Do not invent OAuth/sessions here without human approval.
- Tests: `node --test` via package `test` script; colocate `*.test.ts` next to code.
- PDF: `src/pdf/`; polished requires unlock. Generation: `src/generation/` (mock + BYOK drivers).
- Mock unlock: gated by `ALLOW_MOCK_UNLOCK` — local/staging only.
- Docs: [docs/api-core.md](../../docs/api-core.md). Skill: `.cursor/skills/core-worker/SKILL.md`.
